&lt;p data-local-id="f14fa27c78b5" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;You have a track record of delivering high-quality software on schedule and collaborating closely with product partners.&lt;/p&gt;
